    LLM: "Game: Badugi. Type: Triple Draw Lowball. Rules: 4-card hands. Maximize unique suits/ranks. 4-card 'Badugi' > 3-card hand. Tie-breaker: Low high-card. 3 draw rounds.",
    Player: "Welcome to Badugi! You have 4 cards. Your goal is to have four cards with NO matching suits and NO matching ranks. If you have two Hearts, one of them doesn't count! Ace is low. You have three draws to find your perfect A-2-3-4. Are you ready?",
    objective: "Capture the pot by holding the lowest qualifying hand at showdown. A 4-card 'Badugi' (all different suits/ranks) is the highest tier of hand.",
    gameplay: '1. **First Betting Round**: Following the blinds. 2. **First Draw**: Players discard any number of cards (0-4) and receive replacements. 3. **Second Betting Round**. 4. **Second Draw**. 5. **Third Betting Round**. 6. **Third Draw**. 7. **Final Betting Round**. 8. **Showdown**.',
